      text The quality of content is more important than the expertise of who contributes it. Wikipedia's content must conform with its , including being  by published . Contributions based on , beliefs, or personal experiences, , libellous material, and  are not allowed and will not remain. Wikipedia's software makes it easy to reverse errors, and experienced   and  bad edits.
